Error: Missing expected argument '--name <name>'
Help:  --name <name>  Simulator name. An existing simulator with this name is reused as-is. When creating, the device type is read from the name if --device-type is omitted, so `--name "iPhone 17"` works on its own.
Usage: grantiva simulator ensure [--json] [--verbose] [--quiet] --name <name> [--device-type <device-type>] [--runtime <runtime>] [--boot] [--no-boot]
  See 'grantiva simulator ensure --help' for more information.
